1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:04,850
Today, every AI engagement is carried
uphill one transaction at a time.

2
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:09,300
We win the customer, deliver the work,
and place another block at the top.

3
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:13,320
Then the contract ends, and we walk back
down to win the next one.

4
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:18,000
New proposal. New mobilisation.
The same climb, every time.

5
00:00:18,430 --> 00:00:21,450
The work accumulates. The relationship
does not. Delivery repeats the cycle.

6
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:27,760
So we keep the catalogue and change
the commitment around it.

7
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:31,780
Entitled Drawdown bundles the first
next step into the sale.

8
00:00:32,230 --> 00:00:36,690
Committed Capacity turns an isolated job
into a pre-committed rhythm of work.

9
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,820
Standing Services keeps the customer
estate operating after the build.

10
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:44,450
Across three years, transaction shrinks
while drawdown, capacity and standing

11
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:47,820
become the load-bearing portfolio.

12
00:00:48,270 --> 00:00:50,900
Enable. Capture. Establish.
Build. Operate.

13
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:54,300
Every offer names the next contract,

14
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:58,300
and every customer commitment becomes
the ground for the next.
